{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/m-WwAwD52gX_BiW6uHdZfA?click_id=3","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:35.611901+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/m-WwAwD52gX_BiW6uHdZfA?click_id=3","html":"<div><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/vcYUKHDfjZ8ibnasYE8hS3UbzZdl77ZFBjPlzSRHFTLYQ7qicflVZYyqyTcHlnric5bzz0EqiaykicCuMeURFxr6nlg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span> </span><span>这里是百年浙大，</span></span></span></p><section><span><span>根植于钟灵毓秀的杭州。</span></span></section><section><span>自1897年创立，</span></section><section><span>浙江大学已成为一所</span></section><section><span>蜚声海内外、特色鲜明的</span></section><section><span>研究型、综合型、创新型高等学府。</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>这里是百年电气，</span></span></section><section><span><span>中国电机工程教育的先驱之地，</span></span></section><section><span>起源于1920年的电机工程学系，</span></section><section><span>浙江大学电气工程学院</span></section><section><span>已走过一个多世纪的辉煌历程。</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>百年积淀，英才辈出。</span></span></section><section><span>作为中国最早创建的电气工程学科之一，</span></section><section><span>学院底蕴深厚，桃李满天下。</span></section><section><span><span>23位曾在此学习或工作的两院院士，以及4万余名遍布全球的杰出校友，</span>共同谱写了服务国家建设与推动电气工程事业发展的壮丽篇章。</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>学院聚焦国家战略与科技前沿，构建卓越研究生培养体系，致力培育具全球竞争力的</span><span>创新人才和领导者</span><span>。<span>诚邀全国高校优秀本科生，通过推荐免试加入浙大电气，共攀学术高峰，书写电气新篇章！</span></span></span></section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/vcYUKHDfjZicj5Iib5E67ypzY1nPne7tMTl27JaCRcia0icxG75icbbibbKiaW4zDXJLvpKQhYaUicpAb9BZUIRMwJibiavQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>一</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span>1.中华人民共和国公民。</span><span><br/></span></span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><span>2.拥护中国共产党的领导，</span><span><span><span>品德良好，</span></span></span><span>遵纪守法</span><span><span>。</span></span></span></section><p><span><span>       </span></span></p><section><span><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，不存在考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果等有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为以及其他违法违纪受处分或受处罚记录。</span><span><br/></span></span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><span>4.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、学术潜质和专业能力。</span></span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><span>5.符合招生学院（系）根据学科专业特点制定的其他学术要求。</span></span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><span>6.身体健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><span>7.预计可获得就读学校推荐免试资格，最终以教育部“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（</span><strong><span>以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址：  http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></strong><span>）备案信息为准，未经推荐高校公示和教育部备案的申请无效。</span></span></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>二</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请办法</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>       </span><span><span>1.申请人根据“<span>浙江大学关于2026年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知</span>”</span><span><span>，详细阅读相关要求和步骤等，进行报名。</span></span><strong><span>电气工程学院报名截止日期为2025年9月10日。</span></strong></span></p><p><span></span><strong><span>(</span></strong><strong><span>网址：</span><span>http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2025/0728/c28498a3071793/page.htm</span></strong><strong><span>)</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>     </span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>三</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>方向填报说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span>☑ 申报</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>直博</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>时，务必选择“招生方向”，具体如下：</span></strong></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>学术学位：电气工程（080800）</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span>        招生方向：</span><strong><span>选以下方向之一</span></strong></span></section><section><span><span>（1）高性能电机系统；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（2）电力系统及其自动化；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（3）电力电子技术； </span></span></section><section><span><span>（4）现代电工理论与新技术；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（5）电气信息技术；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（6）电磁环境效应及评估；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（7）浙江大学-海军工程大学联合培养专项；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（8）浙江大学-怀柔实验室联合培养专项。</span></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>学术学位：控制理论与控制工程（081101）</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>        招生方向：智能控制理论及应用。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>专业学位：电气工程（085801）</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span>        招生方向：</span><strong><span>选以下方向之一</span></strong></span></section><section><span><span>（1）高性能电机系统；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（2）电力系统及其自动化；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（3）电力电子技术； </span></span></section><section><span><span>（4）现代电工理论与新技术；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（5）电气信息技术；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（6）电磁环境效应及评估；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（7）浙江大学-海军工程大学联合培养专项；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（8）浙江大学-怀柔实验室联合培养专项。</span></span></section></section></section><p><span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>☑ 申报</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>硕士</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>时，务必选择“招生方向”，具体如下：</span></strong></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>学术学位：电气工程（080800）</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span>        招生方向：</span><strong><span>选以下方向之一</span></strong></span></section><section><span><span>（1）电机系统及其控制研究所；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（2）电力系统自动化研究所及电力能源互联及其智能化研究所及电能存储技术研究所；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（3）电力电子技术研究所；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（4）电工电子新技术研究所；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（5）特种电气交叉研究中心(电磁环境效应及评估)。</span></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>学术学位：控制理论与控制工程（081101）</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>       招生方向：电气自动化研究所及系统科学与控制研究所。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>专业学位：电气工程（085801）</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span>        招生方向：</span><strong><span>选以下方向之一</span></strong></span></section><section><span><span>（1）电机系统及其控制研究所；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（2）电力系统自动化研究所及电力能源互联及其智能化研究所及电能存储技术研究所；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（3）电力电子技术研究所；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（4）电工电子新技术研究所；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（5）电气自动化研究所及系统科学与控制研究所；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（6）特种电气交叉研究中心(电磁环境效应及评估)；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（7）浙江大学-海军工程大学联合培养专项。</span></span></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>四</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>相关材料提交</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>除学校通知要求的材料外，以下材料电子版须打包上传（请每个文件单独打包，不要整合在1个pdf文件）到报名系统中“其他附件”一栏。</span></strong></span></section><section><span><span>附件一般包括：</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>1.有效身份证扫描件、历年在校学习成绩单、</span><span>大学英语等级证书扫描件</span><span>（填报外语成绩要明确“四级、六级、还是其他”）、已发表过的学术论文或工作成果的复印件或证明、在曾从事过的科技活动中获奖或表现突出的证明。（尽量扫描成pdf文件，如果拍照，请务必能保证打印清晰）</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>2.申请直接攻读博士学位者还须提供两位与申请学科相关的副教授（或相当职称）及以上专家的 “专家推荐书”（见以下附件）。请务必保留专家签字的推荐书原件，以便复试时上交。</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/m-WwAwD52gX_BiW6uHdZfA?click_id=3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>浙江大学攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐书.docx</span></a></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>3.所在大学的推免资格证明及成绩排名等，填报时成绩排名应是6个学期（3年），请填写保研绩点排名，若填写三年课程绩点排名，请在备注里或个人陈述中说明情况。（推免资格证明暂时没有的，请在备注上说明原因及本人成绩排序，如审核后，具有复试资格，则复试时提交盖章版的推免证明）。</span></span></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>五</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>       1.申请者在网上填报即可（初审是否通过即是否具有复试资格，参照往年，一般是在报名截止日（9月10日）以后统一审核确定，请关注电气工程学院官网-人才培养-研究生招生栏目。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>       2.初审通过具有复试资格的学生，复试时须具有本科所在院校的推免资格。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>       3.填报申请材料不得弄虚作假，一经发现，立即取消其来我校的免试读研资格，并通报申请人所在学校。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>       4.请务必保证系统中填写的手机号和邮箱能第一时间联系到申请者本人，以免错过重要通知。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>       5.咨询联系人，王老师，eewangxiao@zju.edu.cn。</span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>供稿</span></span><span><span>｜</span></span><span><span>浙江大学电气工程学院研究生教育教学办公室</span></span></p><p><span><span>今日编辑</span><span><span>｜崔   傲</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>责任编辑</span></span><span><span>｜王苏蓉</span></span></p><p><span><span><span></span></span></span></p><section><span></span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/vcYUKHDfjZ8vKNJZ9iaicWkomMibFjqjv9lWK7pHibhYLXzzBibWO5pRG3rgBfYuaQ6oQdiaXV3hvHh5lviaWX3rF4ib6w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p></p></div>","textSha256":"0da7ffe25c86da65cca90508c8c31617f90c2ba2b07b3160488089d080d39d21","textLength":2244,"sourceSha256":"3c2ab6db3786767e9b21a66ba072c5c73c9cc141162c243a5b3e70d8da00dff5","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-23eeb28ba27bbca57689","title":"2025年浙江大学电气工程学院关于2025年接收2026级外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:35.611901+00:00"}
